 r"I am writing to apply for the Junior Engineer role at Artefact in London. I completed an MSc in Health Data Science at University College London in September 2026, where a distinction is expected, after a BSc in Biological Sciences at Imperial College London, and I currently work as a Data Analyst Intern at TikTok Shop UK. Across my academic and professional experience I have written Python pipelines, built machine learning models and AI tools, and delivered them to the people who use them.",

